# Rust build artifacts — never commit, always prunable (docs/build.md)
/target/
target-*/

# Per-tool target dirs we deliberately keep out of the default target
/target-cov/
/target-dist/

# Installed skill bodies (.agents/skills/**). These are third-party content fetched by a skills
# installer and pinned by `skills-lock.json` (source + computedHash); commit the lock, not the
# copies. `mta` reads them from disk when present — docs/agents.md §2.
/.agents/

# Build/test leftovers
**/*.rs.bk
*.profraw
*.profdata
perf.data*
*.sccache

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.DS_Store
